Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:55.00,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.00,Note,NTP,0,0,0,,(瑞福特精神病院)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.55,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened that night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:08.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Dean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:11.45,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们亲眼目睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What they witnessed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:12.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.98,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sent two brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.86,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad is on a hunting trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:18.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此踏上征途 22年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On a quest for answers. 22 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.67,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓我再也不猎魔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swore I was done hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:24.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有活儿干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.97,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是老爸最珍贵的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is dad's single, most valuable possession
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他所有知道的关于恶魔的东西都记载在这里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything he knows about every evil thing, it is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.68,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.85,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 拯救人类 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:41.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.77,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我得找出杀杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.36,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我现在唯一想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:47.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你知道我们会找到爸爸的 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, you know that we're gonna find dad, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:50.48,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:33.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怕坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nervous flyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:35.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it that obvious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道死于空难的概率多大吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what are the odds of dying in a plane crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:40.86,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两万分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean what, twenty thousands to one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:47.95,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真让我安心了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it's really reassuring, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:15.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿曼达 你今天怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amanda, how are you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.48,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挺好的 查克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm doing just fine, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎登机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:23.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15排c座 就在机尾右侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}15-C towards the back of the plane on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您旅途愉快 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have a nice flight, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I'm counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:42.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}11排f座 在机舱中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}11-F, that's at the middle of the plane on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.47,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.68,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.36,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰一下 飞机起飞多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me. Do you know how long we have been up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.66,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概40分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About forty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:07.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间如飞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow! Time really does fly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我伸展一下筋骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me. I've got to stretch my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该死的在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, what the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morning, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概5 45\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it's about 5:45.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:59.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在是早上 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- In the morning? - Yap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:00.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where does the day go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:03.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚你睡着了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you get any sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 睡了几小时 - 骗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah, I got a couple of hours. - You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我三点醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See, I was up at 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.48,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你正在看乔治·福尔曼资讯式广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you were watching George Foreman informercials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.35,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能说什么呢 蛮好看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What can I say? Riveting TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最后一次睡安稳觉是什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When's the last time you got a good night sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:16.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不记得了 不久前吧 这无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. A little while I guess. It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:17.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:19.25,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 感激你的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, I appreciate your concern...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.65,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才不关心你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I'm not concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:23.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的工作是保护我 所以精神点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's your job to keep my ass alive! So I need you sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:26.74,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实说 你还在做关于杰西的噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seriously you're still having nightmares about Jess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:32.45,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:36.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不只是她 而是所有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's not just her, it's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:40.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能我忘了 这种工作缠上我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just forgot, you know, this job... man, it gets to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:43.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能任由这样 你不能让它占据你生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you can't let it. You can't bring it home like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:47.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这些东西从来没有让你在晚上惊醒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what? All this it never keeps you up at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从不 你从不害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never?! You never afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:50.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不怕 真的不怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 随你怎么说 懒得和你争辩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, whatever. I'm too tired to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 - 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hallo? - Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:16.74,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是 杰瑞·潘诺斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's huh... It's Jerry Panowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:19.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你的父亲几年前帮过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your dad helped me out a couple of years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.17,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:24.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宾夕法尼亚的科特宁镇 那个恶作剧鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, up in Kittanning, Pensylvania. The poltergeist thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它不会又回来了吧 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's not back, is it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.55,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:29.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:34.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是其它的东西 我觉得可能更严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's something else and I think it could be a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:35.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以面谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can we talk in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.65,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们这么快赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks for making the trip so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:47.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该帮助你们 不是让你们帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ought to be doing you guys a favour, not the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩和你爸真帮了我大忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean and your dad really helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他告诉过我 是个恶作剧鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, he told me. It was a poltergeist?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:53.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《鬼驱人》 伙计 我喜欢那部电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poltergeist? Man, I loved that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人和你说话 走你的路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, nobody is talking to you, keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:57.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个该死的恶作剧鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn right it was a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎拆了我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}poltergeist practically it tore our house apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:04.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是没你和你爸 我可能早就挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it wasn't for you and your dad I probably wouldn't be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸提到过你要去上大学 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your dad said you are off to college, that's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:11.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经是的 我现在休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I was. I'm... taking some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢说 他真为你感到自豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was really proud of you, I could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.68,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他总是说到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He talked about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:18.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是吗 - 是的 他真是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He did? - Yeah, you bet he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试着联系他 但是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, hey, you know I tried to get hold of him but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:22.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is he doing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:26.95,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他 现在忙于工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is... wrapped up in a job right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:29.74,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀念老家伙的同时 萨姆来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we're missing the old man, we get a Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.28,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}平等交易 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even trade, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:33.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 绝不是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not by a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些东西让你们听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got something I want you guys to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I listened to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:41.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来好像出现过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, sounded like it was appear on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:43.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常理来说 我没办法拿到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Normally, I wouldn't have access to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:44.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是驾驶室录音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the cockpit voice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:47.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国不列颠航空公司2485航班的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}recorder for the United Britannian flight 2485.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们公司的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求救 求救 重复求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayday! Mayday! Repeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:53.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是美国不列颠航空2485航班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the United Britannian flight 2485...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要你们立即给予指示 我们需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We wants you to give immediately instructions. We need help...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:58.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国不列颠2485航班 我们收到求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}United Britannian Flight 2485, we copy your mayday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:02.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们有机械故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe we are experiencing some... mechanical failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:15.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这起飞 坠毁在大概往南200英里处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Took off from here... crashed about two hundred miles up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:17.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他们说是机械失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now they'er saying mechanical failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某种原因导致机仓减压 没人知道为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cabin depressurized somehow, nobody knows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:23.83,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机上有超过100人 只有7人幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over a hundred people onboard, only seven we got alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个是驾驶员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pilot was one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫查克·兰博特 他是我的好友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name is Chuck Lambert, he is a good friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查克是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chuck is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:34.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他无法承受此事 认为是自己的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, he's pretty broken up about it. Like it was his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:37.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你认为不是 - 是 我认为不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You don't think it was? - No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰瑞 我们要乘客名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jerry, we're gonna need passenger manifests,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:41.60,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和幸存者名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A list of the survivors...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:44.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 我们要看看飞机残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right, and a... We'll need take a look at the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其它的资料没问题 但是飞机残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The other stuff is no problem, but the wreckage...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:51.36,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全国安全运输委员会的人把它锁在了证物库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fellows in NTSB has it lockdown in an evidence warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:54.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我进不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No way I've got that clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:03.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey! - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:07.75,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么呆了那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要完美就不能急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't rush perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国土安全局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Homeland security?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:14.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是违法的 甚至对我们来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's pretty illegal. Even for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:16.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 这是新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, well? Something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:19.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 别人可不会注意它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, people have seen it a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你查到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, so what you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:28.07,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾驶室录音里有超自然电子异象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, there is definitely EVP on the cockpit voice recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:29.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是吗 - 听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah? - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:35.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无人幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No survivors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无人幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:41.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思 有7个幸存者啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that supposed to mean? There were seven survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难倒我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:46.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么认为 闹鬼的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what you think? A haunted flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.67,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多关于飞机和轮船的幽灵和死亡预兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is long history of spirits and death omens
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像是幻影旅者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on planes, on ships like phantom travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得401航班吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or, do you remember flight 401?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:55.09,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 那架失事的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right, the one that crasher,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:58.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}航空公司把它的一些部件装到了其它飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the airlines salvaged some of its parts put in other planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:00.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾驶员和副驾驶员的鬼魂缠上了那些部件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the spirits of the pilot and co-pilot haunted those parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Right. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们遇到了相同的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we've similar deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:06.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这些幸存者 你想先和谁谈谈呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, so the survivors. Which one we have to talk to first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名单上的第三个 马克思·杰夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Third on the list. Max Jaffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:10.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一 他住在这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For one, he lives around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:14.65,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二 如果有人看到怪异的东西 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and two, if anyone saw anything weird, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.66,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:18.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和他妈妈聊过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I spoke to his mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.45,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她告诉我去哪找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she told me where we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:26.28,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白 我已经和国土安全局谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand. I already spoke with homeland security.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:27.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.09,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有新的信息出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As new information has come up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:31.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你能回答几个问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so if you could just answer a couple of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:35.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在飞机下落前 你注意到有异常吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just before the plain went down, did you notice anything unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:41.10,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇怪的光 也许是诡异的噪音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strange lights, weird noises maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}声音之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mister Jaffe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:49.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 杰夫 - 杰夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Jaffee. - Jaffee...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己要求住进来的 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You checked yourself in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:53.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能问问是为什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:57.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点焦虑不安 从一次坠机事件中生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a little stressed, I survived a plain crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:01.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么吓到你了 就是说你怕的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that's what terrified you? And that's what you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:04.25,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再也不想谈这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I... I don't wanna talk about this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:06.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得也许你在飞机上看见了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think maybe you did see something up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要知道你看见了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:12.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不 只是我的幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No, I was delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:16.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看到了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:20.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:24.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你告诉我们 你觉得自己看见了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then just tell us what you thought you saw, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞机上有个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:37.36,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And... he had these... eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:38.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:42.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I saw him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:53.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:57.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打开紧急出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He opened the emergency exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:02.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是不可能的 是吧 我查过资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that's... that's impossible. Right? I mean, I looked that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那门上几乎有2吨的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is something like two tons of pressure on that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:09.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:13.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个人 是不是突然出现又突然消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man, uh, did he seemed to appear and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:16.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快 就像幻影一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rapidly, he would looked something like a mirage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是疯子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you, nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:24.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个乘客 就坐我前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a passanger, he was sitting right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:32.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治·菲尔浦斯 20排C座的乘客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}George Phelps. Seat 20-C.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:39.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不管你有多强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hm. Man, I don't care how strong you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:43.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使你嗑了药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even you hopped up on PCP or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不可能在飞机飞行中打开紧急出口门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No way you can open up an emergency door during the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是人类就不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, if you're a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:52.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这个家伙 乔治 是别的什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But maybe this guy, George, is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.68,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}披着人形外衣的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some kind of a creature maybe, in human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你看这像是那种生物的巢穴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this look like where a creature's lair to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的前夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your late husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这就是我的乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, that was my George.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:12.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说他是个 牙医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you said, he was a... dentist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:17.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他飞去丹佛参加一个会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was headed to a convention in Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:22.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他很怕坐飞机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know, that he was petrified to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:28.09,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他来说那样出行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For him to go like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们结婚多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long have you been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}13年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}13 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.68,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all that time, did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:42.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有没有注意到他的奇怪举止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you ever noticed anything strange about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何不正常的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything out of ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有胃酸倒流 这是你们指的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had acid reflux, if that's what you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:00.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈话毫无结果 没有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean it goes without saying it's doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.09,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个患有胃溃疡的中年牙医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A middle-aged dentist with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:04.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那种邪恶人格的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an ulcers is not exactly evil-personified.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我们要做的就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what we need to do is getting inside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进入运输委员会的仓库 检查残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the NTSB warehouse check out the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:13.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们要那么做 最好乔装一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if we're gonna go down around, we better look depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:22.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我看上去就像《福禄双霸天》的男主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man, I look like one of the "Blues Brothers".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:26.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你更像第一次参加舞会的七年级生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look more like a seventh grader at his first dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:30.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讨厌这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:33.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还想不想混进仓库呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, you want to go in that warehouse or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个电磁场探测仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an EMF meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可以探测电磁频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It metes electromagnetic frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我知道电磁场探测仪是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, I know what an EMF meter is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:28.17,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为什么这个看上去像个烂随身听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but why is that it looks like as a busted up walkman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:31.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我做的 纯手工哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why I made it out of. It's homamade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}检查下紧急出口的门把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check out the emergency door handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:11.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是什么 - 让我们查明这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is this stuff? - We are going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国土安全局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Homeland security?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:28.60,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦 一对还不够吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? One of you two guys isn't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:29.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:32.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们的两个人5分钟前进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two of your budies went inside not 5 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:14.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这身衣服真碍事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, these Mort's suits do come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 查克 重新振作起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, Chuck. Let's get back on the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:20.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是这次 是个小双引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only in this case, it's a little twin engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是个大飞机 是个小飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not even a horse, more like a pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也会陪着你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'll be right there with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.83,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么时候不想驾驶了 我来开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anytime you feel you don't want the wheel, I'll take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 查克 今天你不是非得这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, Chuck. You don't have to do this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想逼你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not try to rush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:35.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 等待让我感觉更难受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No... the waiting is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 他们加满油了 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, they fueled up the tank. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个东西上面覆盖了硫磺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This stuff is covered in sulphur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:17.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.96,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take a look for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:22.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 我要解雇那个蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you fellas would excuse me, I have an idiot to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:26.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱因斯坦 就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Einstein! Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:28.10,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底在干嘛 放下扳手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell you doing?! Put the wrench down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:31.78,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里没有留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, there is not too many things
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.70,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太多的硫磺残渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that leave behind sulphuric residue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:34.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶魔附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Demonic possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:36.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可以解释一个凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would explain how a mortal man
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:38.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会有力气打开紧急舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would've the strength to open up the emergency hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:40.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他被附身 这就有可能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he got possessed, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.37,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 这超出那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, this goes way beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:44.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}漂浮在床上或呕吐出豌豆汤之类的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}floating over a bed, or barf from pea soup,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.96,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}附身在某人身上是一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's one thing to possess a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是利用他去毁掉整架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to use him to take down an entire airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你之前听说过这样的事情吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ever heard something like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我准备好了 开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm ready. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:08.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.19,0:19:10.39,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快你就可以重新驾驶大喷气式飞机啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll be back flying jumbos before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们飞了多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long we've been up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:18.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概40分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Almost forty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:21.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间如飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow! The time really does fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:57.26,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每种宗教 地球上每种文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So... every religion and every world culture...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:20:00.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都有关于恶魔和附身的概念 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has the concept of demons and demonic possession, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如基督教 印第安人 印度教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them christian, native american, hindu,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你随便举一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是没有一个描述过这类事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah but not one described anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:06.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不完全是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well that's not exactly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.19,0:20:07.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 根据小日本的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see, according japanese believes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:10.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}灾难是恶魔引起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}certain demons are behind some disasters,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.23,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然的或人为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}both natural and man made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:14.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前者造成地震 后者引发疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One causes earthquake, and other causes desease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这个导致坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this causes plane crashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:21.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.79,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有个与时俱进的恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have a demon that's evolved with the times,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他慢慢学会了占据人身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and found a way to ratchet up the body count?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:27.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 在这架飞机之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you know, who knows how
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:32.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁知道他还使得多少架飞机坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}many planes he's brought down before this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我是说这不是常规的闹鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know, I mean this is not a normal gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:43.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 恶魔们无所求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, demons, they don't want anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只想随心所欲地造成死亡和破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just death and destruction for their own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:47.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这玩大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:49.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸在就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish that dad was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:52.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 - 迪恩 我是杰瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hello? - Dean, it's Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:02.61,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你好 杰瑞 - 我那个驾驶员朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, hi, Jerry. - My pilot friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:05.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查克·兰博特死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chuck Lambert is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:09.75,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰瑞 我很难过 发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jerry, I'm sorry. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和他朋友上了架小飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He and his buddy went up in a small twin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:14.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是1小时前飞机坠毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but an hour ago the plain went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:15.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}距这里60英里以西 在拿撒勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's 60 miles west of here, in Nazareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试着忽略这里面的讽刺意味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will try to ignore the irony in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:20.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:21.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰瑞 等在那里 我们马上赶到你那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jerry, hang on there. I will catch up with you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 又一起坠机 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Another crash? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 走吧 - 去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Let's go. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿撒勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nazareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:43.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}硫磺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sulphur?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:47.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:51.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 两起坠机事件都和查克·兰博特有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, so there're two plane crashes involving Chuck Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:53.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去好像恶魔跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This demon sounds like goes after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.00,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无意冒犯查克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With all respect to Chuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:58.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要真是这样 这是个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that's the case, that would be a good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:21:59.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那坏消息是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:01.93,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查克的飞机在起飞40分钟后坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chuck's plane went down exactly forty minutes on the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.85,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个 2485航班也是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And get this, so the flight 2485.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:07.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}40分钟 这意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}40 minutes? What is that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.98,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是圣经上的数字命理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's biblical numerology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:10.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 诺亚方舟的故事 下了40天雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, Noah's ark, it rained for forty days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:12.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个数字意味着死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That number means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:15.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查阅以往的资料 过去10年有6起坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went back and there were six plane crashes over the last decade
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:19.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是起飞40分钟后坠毁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that all went down exactly forty minutes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:20.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有幸存者吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:24.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 除了最近的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Or it not until now at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:26.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}2485航班 不知什么原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until 2485 for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:30.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得驾驶室录音里的超自然电子异象说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the cockpit voice recorder remember what the EVP said?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.33,0:22:31.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无人幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:36.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在追逐所有的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's going after all the survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:39.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它要完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It should finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:43.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:45.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你接受我们的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we thank you taking our survey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:47.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你若是要坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if you do plan a flight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.01,0:22:50.23,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请记得考虑美国不列颠航空公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't forget your friends at United Britannia Airlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.23,0:22:51.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:52.61,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. That takes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:54.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布兰·桑得森和丹尼斯·夏洛威啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}care of Blane Sanderson and Dennis Holloway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:56.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们最近不会坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're not flying any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:59.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么唯一的线索就是空姐阿曼达·沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So the only wild card is the fly attendant, Amanda Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 她妹妹卡伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right. Her sister Karen
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.22,0:23:02.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说她的航班晚上8点从明尼阿波利斯市起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}said her flight leaves in Minneapolis at 8pm,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:03.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是她重回工作岗位的第一晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's her first night back on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.82,0:23:05.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来貌似我们运气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It sounds like we just our luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:08.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 要开5个小时的车 你不行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, this is an 5 hour drive, man. Even with you by the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:10.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干嘛不再打打阿曼达的手机呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you call Amanda's cellphone again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:11.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我们能否截住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See if we can head her off the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:13.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经给她留了3个语音信息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I already left her three voice messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她关了手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she just turned her cellphone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:19.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天哪 我们做不到 - 能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- God! We never gonna make it. - We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.31,0:23:35.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里 30分钟后登机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right there. It will boarding in thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:37.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我们还有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, we still left some cards to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:39.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gonna need find a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机场服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Airport services.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:45.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我在13号门 - 您想找谁 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm at gate 13. - Who you wanna call, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.53,0:23:46.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想找阿曼达·沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm trying contact with an Amanda Walker,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:50.58,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个空姐 在424航班上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is a flight attendant on a flight hm... flight 424.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:51.74,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿曼达·沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amanda Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:53.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿曼达·沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amanda Walker,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:56.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有个13号门的白色电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have a phone call white call signal from gate 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.62,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.01,0:24:02.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是阿曼达·沃克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Amanda Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:03.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.92,0:24:06.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是詹姆斯·海德菲尔得医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hi, this is Dr. James Hetfield from St.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:08.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自圣弗朗西斯纪念医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Francis Memorial Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:11.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们有位病人卡伦·沃克 - 我的卡伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We have a Karen Walker here. - My Karen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.02,0:24:13.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况不是很严重 只是一起小车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing serious just a minor car accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.29,0:24:14.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她受伤了 所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But she was injured so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.81,0:24:17.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等下 这不可能 我刚和她通过电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, wait, that's impossible. I just got off the phone with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:22.86,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你什么 - 5分钟前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You what? - Five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.86,0:24:25.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在家 为期末考试填鸭呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's at her house cramming for a final...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:26.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.74,0:24:30.37,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's must be some mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.37,0:24:32.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How would do you even know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:35.61,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是文斯的一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this one of Vince's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被你猜中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guilties charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.13,0:24:41.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他真的很对不起你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.42,0:24:45.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉他管好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you tell him to mind his own business
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.47,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离我远点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and stay out of my life. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:50.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 但他今晚很想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. But, he really needs to see you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.93,0:24:53.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以 - 不行 对不起 太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So... - No, I'm sorry, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:55.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要这样 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't be like that! Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.45,0:24:58.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙一团糟 真的好可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy's a mess, really, a pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:25:00.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.02,0:25:01.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:05.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我得走了 告诉他我落地后打给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I gotta go... tell him to call me when I landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.27,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别别 等等 阿曼达 阿曼达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, wait, Amanda... Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.70,0:25:14.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 鲍勃 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey, Bob. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:25.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:27.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就差一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.30,0:25:32.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 执行B计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, it's time for plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:33.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们登上那架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're getting on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.97,0:25:35.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.22,0:25:37.36,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 那架飞机就要起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, that plane is leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:38.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}机上有100多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with over a hundred passengers on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:41.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我们的猜想是对的 那架飞机就会坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if we're right, that plane is gonna crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.73,0:25:42.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那我们登机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Then we're getting on that plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.13,0:25:45.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找到那个恶魔然后驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to find that demon and exorcise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.94,0:25:46.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我去买票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I'll get the tickets,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.72,0:25:48.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你尽可能的去捣乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you just go get whatever you can out of the trunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.20,0:25:49.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever will make it through security,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:50.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们5分钟后这里见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}meet me back here in 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.62,0:25:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.04,0:25:57.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 一点也不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.54,0:26:00.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:04.41,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I kind of have this problem with...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.92,0:26:07.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.42,0:26:09.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在才发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's never been an issue until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.34,0:26:10.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.34,0:26:11.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看我像是在开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I look like I'm joking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:15.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我为什么要开车旅行 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you think I drive everywhere, Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.02,0:26:18.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.02,0:26:19.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 我自己搞定这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - I'll do this one my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.02,0:26:21.39,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己说过那架飞机会坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said yourself that's plane gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.81,0:26:24.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 迪恩 要么我们一起 要么我单干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, Dean, we can do it together, I can do this one by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.73,0:26:26.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有第三种选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not seeing a third option here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:28.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.11,0:26:31.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.23,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.34,0:26:49.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你试着放松 - 你试着闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Just try to relax. - Just try to shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:24.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你在哼金属狂热的歌 - 这让我冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Are you humming Metallica? - Calms me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:28.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 兄弟 我知道你紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, man, I get you're nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.53,0:27:30.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你要集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all right? But you got to stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:34.98,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我是说 我们还有32分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. I mean, we got 32 minutes and counting
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.98,0:27:38.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到那个东西 不管它附到谁的身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to track this thing down or whoever it's possessing anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.11,0:27:39.78,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要完成驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and perform a full exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:41.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 在拥挤的飞机上会轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, on a crowded airplane that's gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:43.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一步一步来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just take one step at a time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:47.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 谁被附身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now... who is it possessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:49.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个 通常是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it's usually gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.43,0:27:51.66,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚弱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}somebody with some sort of weakness you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.66,0:27:54.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样恶魔才能钻空子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a chink in the armor that the demon can worm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:56.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸毒的 有情绪困扰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Somebody with an addiction, or some sort of emotional distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:01.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是坠机后阿曼达第一次飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well this is Amanda's first flight after the crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.34,0:28:03.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要是她肯定心中慌乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I were her I'd be messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:08.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰一下 你是阿曼达吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me. Are you Amanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.01,0:28:09.26,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:10.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.73,0:28:17.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 阿曼达肯定会回到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, well, it's got to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:20.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我就可以和她说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be Amanda back there, so I could talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:23.15,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去了解一下她的精神状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And uh... I'll get a read on her mental state.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.24,0:28:24.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是她已被附身 怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if she is already possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:27.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我方法测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is a way to test that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:30.99,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带了圣水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I brought holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.83,0:28:33.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 我想我们要用更可靠的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I think we can go more settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:36.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她被附身 她会在上帝之名前畏缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she's possessed, she'll flinch at the name of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.63,0:28:37.95,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.42,0:28:40.45,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.84,0:28:42.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 咋啦 - 用拉丁语说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Say it in Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.84,0:28:43.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:48.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 又咋啦 - 拉丁语是Christo\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What?! - In latin it's Christo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:50.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 我知道 我不是白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, I know! I'm not an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.23,0:29:01.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们先生们 这是首次机长讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies and gentlemen this is the first officer speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:04.52,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:06.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么需要帮助的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I help you in something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.81,0:29:09.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 我只是有点晕机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, no. I'm just a bit of an uneasy flier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.74,0:29:11.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处转转会让我舒服点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Makes me feel better to walk around a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:13.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, it happens with the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:15.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 你作为空姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, you being a stewardess,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:17.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想坐飞机对你来说很轻松吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess flying comes easy to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:19.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会惊讶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:22.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 你坐飞机也紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really? You... you're a nervous flyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.34,0:29:24.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许 有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, maybe. A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.34,0:29:28.84,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}害怕飞行却在当空姐 你怎么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is it though being a stewardes you're scared to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.13,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kind of a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:33.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 不好意思提到这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, I'm sorry for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.81,0:29:35.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.73,0:29:37.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从未考虑过其它的职业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You never considered other employment?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.60,0:29:39.76,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:42.47,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 每个人都有害怕的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, everybody scared of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:45.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是 我不会屈服于它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just... I'm not gonna let it hold me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:56.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.00,0:30:05.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't... I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.42,0:30:07.33,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, nothing, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:11.92,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.60,0:30:20.60,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 她肯定是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, she is gotta be
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:22.31,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞机上状态最好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the most well-adjusted person on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说了Christo\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said Christo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:24.02,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.03,0:30:26.28,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没被附身 恶魔不在她身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no demon in her. There is no demon getting in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:29.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可能是飞机上的任何人 任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it is on the plane could be anyone, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.32,0:30:31.82,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 这不正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, that can be normal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:34.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是小空气乱流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey! Hey... just a little turbulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 这架飞机要坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, this plane is going to crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:38.16,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 不要再把我当傻瓜看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}okay? So quit treating me like I'm freaking fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:40.12,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你要冷静下来 - 对不起 我不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You need to calm down. - Well, I'm sorry I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:41.53,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.92,0:30:43.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 对自己说肉麻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, stow the touchy-feely,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.46,0:30:45.59,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自助瑜伽之类废话 没用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}self-help-yoga crap. It's not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:47.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你要是恐慌 就容易被恶魔附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, you're panicked, you're wide open to demonic possession,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.38,0:30:50.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你要冷静 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you need to calm yourself down, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.31,0:31:00.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.44,0:31:05.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我找到一个驱魔咒 我觉得会有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I found an exorcism in here that I think is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:07.27,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马礼书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Rituale Romanum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.32,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What we have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:10.55,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个为两部分 第一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's two parts. The first
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.55,0:31:12.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把恶魔从受害者的身体里驱除出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}part is spells the demon from the victim's body
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.91,0:31:16.11,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它显形 这会让它更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and makes it manifest which actually makes him more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 更强大 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- More powerful? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:18.24,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:20.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它不再需要附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it doesn't need to possess someone anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:22.03,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就可以随心所欲的破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it can just break out and go on it's own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:24.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, and why is that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.19,0:31:28.91,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为第二部分 把这个混蛋送回地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, because the second part sends the bastard back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.01,0:31:30.42,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一劳永逸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.63,0:31:33.71,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 我们要找到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First things first we gotta find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.51,0:32:12.83,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伙计 别这样 - 发现什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Man! Don't do that! - Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.93,0:32:14.72,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没有 我们还有多长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, nothing, how much time we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.72,0:32:16.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.22,0:32:18.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们遗漏了某人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we missed somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.31,0:32:21.01,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许那个东西不在飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe the thing is just not on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:23.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.94,0:32:25.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你这么想我就这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I will, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.41,0:32:35.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.69,0:32:57.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不会相信这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.19,0:32:58.81,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只剩12分钟了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}12 minutes, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.69,0:33:01.77,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.20,0:33:03.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你不会觉得飞机太颠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The flight's not too bumpy for you I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.91,0:33:06.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 我们要和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually that's kind of what we need to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.20,0:33:08.48,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 有什么可以帮你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.58,0:33:10.20,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这听起来很疯狂 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is going to sound nuts, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:11.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们没时间进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we just don't have time for
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:13.21,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是真像 之类的演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The Truth is Out There" Speach right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.21,0:33:15.28,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我们知道你在2485航班上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, we know you were on the flight 2485.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.67,0:33:17.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们这些人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.88,0:33:19.67,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我们和其他的幸存者谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, we spoken some of the other survivors,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.67,0:33:21.38,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道有些东西使得飞机坠毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we know something brought down that plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.38,0:33:22.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是机械故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it wasn't mechanical failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.80,0:33:23.67,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.67,0:33:26.22,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们要阻止它再次发生 在这里就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because we need to stop from happening again, here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.22,0:33:28.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我很忙 我要回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry... I'm very busy, I have to go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.51,0:33:29.47,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.47,0:33:30.89,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不会伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not hurt you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.89,0:33:34.77,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说 2485航班驾驶员查克·兰博特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But listen to me. The pilot on 2485, Chuck Lambert,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.77,0:33:36.10,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:37.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.69,0:33:39.10,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查克死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chuck is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:40.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死于坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He died in a plane crach.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:42.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}2个月内2起坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that's two plane crashes in two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.40,0:33:44.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得有点奇怪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That doesn't strike you a little strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.07,0:33:46.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 2485航班上有些东西不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, there was something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.08,0:33:47.98,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你感觉到了 也许没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with 2485 now maybe you sensed it, maybe you didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.99,0:33:49.49,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这次航班上也有些东西不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there's something wrong with this flight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:50.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿曼达 你要信我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amanda, you have to believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.29,0:34:02.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}2485航班上有个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On 2485 there was this man...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.09,0:34:04.26,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he have this eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.26,0:34:05.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这就是我们想说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, that's exactly what we're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.88,0:34:07.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你们要我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand what are you asking me to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.80,0:34:09.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找副驾驶 我们要你把他带过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get the co-pilot, we need you to bring him back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.43,0:34:11.51,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 他和这个有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? What does he have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.60,0:34:14.18,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没时间解释 只要和他谈谈 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't have time to explain, we just need to talk to him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.18,0:34:16.18,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么才能进到驾驶室 叫来副驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How am I supposed to going to the cockpit and get the co-pilot...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.19,0:34:17.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽你所能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever it takes! Do whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:18.98,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他这里有东西坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just tell that something's broken back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.98,0:34:20.48,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要把他带出驾驶室 怎么做都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever that'll get him out of that cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.48,0:34:22.27,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我会因此失去工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that I can lose my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.28,0:34:24.69,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你不帮我们 你会失去更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll lose lot more than that if you don't help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.78,0:34:31.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.28,0:35:12.90,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出了什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.21,0:35:20.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你们要把他怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, what are you doing with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:21.67,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过你只想和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said you just wanna talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.67,0:35:23.08,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们马上就谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are gonna talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.93,0:35:29.96,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.80,0:35:33.47,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 他怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my God! What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.47,0:35:34.76,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, we need you to calm down,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:37.60,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}站到帘子外面 不让任何人进来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we need you outside of the curtain. Don't let anybody in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:38.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能做到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.48,0:35:40.39,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿曼达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.40,0:35:41.60,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:46.43,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 萨姆 我不知道还能压住他多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurry up, Sam. I don't know how much longer I can hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.90,0:35:51.86,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Regna terrae cantate Deo: psallite Domino...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.99,0:35:55.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}qui vehitur per caelus, caelos antiquos...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.67,0:36:03.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我抓住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, I get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.50,0:36:07.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ecce, edit vocem suam, vocem potentem Agnoscite potentiam Dei!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.51,0:36:09.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你女朋友的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what happened to your girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.59,0:36:13.29,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她惨叫着死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She must have died screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.68,0:36:15.88,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是现在 她也在燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even now, she burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.39,0:36:19.30,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.40,0:36:26.40,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et potentia ejus in nubibus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.40,0:36:27.39,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抓着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.09,0:36:49.80,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它去哪了 - 飞机里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where it go? - It's on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:51.50,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 我们得解决它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurry up! We gotta finish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.73,0:37:08.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.63,0:37:32.16,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Timendus est Deus e sancto suo...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.93,0:37:39.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ipse potentiam dat et...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.06,0:37:41.05,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gloria Patri.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.58,0:38:43.14,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定你不能告诉我发生了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure you can't tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.14,0:38:45.28,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我在机场工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. I was working at the airport,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.28,0:38:46.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就什么也不知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then it all goes blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.77,0:38:48.76,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我甚至不知道自己怎么上的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't even know how I get on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.56,0:38:51.97,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其它的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:53.76,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没了 就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.07,0:38:58.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.45,0:39:05.86,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.45,0:39:09.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.04,0:39:11.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.67,0:39:15.87,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它知道杰西卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It knew about Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.96,0:39:21.75,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 这些东西可以读心 它们撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, these things, they read minds. They lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.13,0:39:23.54,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吗 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right? That's all it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.14,0:39:26.17,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.27,0:39:29.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.15,0:39:37.56,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每人知道你们做了什么 但我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody knows what you guys did, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.86,0:39:40.64,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不是你们 很多人会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lot of people could have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.07,0:39:43.94,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们的爸爸一定会以此为傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your dad is gonna be real proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.03,0:39:45.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 杰瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll see you around, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.87,0:39:50.57,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 杰瑞 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey, Jerry! - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.04,0:39:53.75,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想问你 你怎么知道我手机号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted to ask you, how did you get my cellphone number anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.75,0:39:55.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才用了6个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only have it from like six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.46,0:39:57.04,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your dad gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.46,0:39:59.34,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 你什么时候和他聊过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - When did you talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.34,0:40:01.46,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有和真的他聊过 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I didn't exactly talked to him but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.26,0:40:05.75,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打他的手机 他的语言留言让我打你电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I called his number, his voice message said to give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.85,0:40:08.63,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再次谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks again, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.74,0:40:26.45,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没道理呀 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This doesn't make any sense, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:29.73,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给爸爸打过50次电话 一直不在服务区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I called dad's number like fifty times. It's been out of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:33.39,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是约翰·温彻斯特 我不能和你联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is John Winchester. I can't be reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.89,0:40:36.44,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有紧急情况 联系我儿子迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If this is an emergency, call my son, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.83,0:40:42.19,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}785- 555- 0179\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}785-555-0179
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.70,0:40:44.09,中上英下,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can help.
